          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.3.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 3:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaganza igihugu, ni murungike ingorore z’imyagazi y’intama muzikūye i Sela, muzicishe mu bugaragwa, muzirungike ku musozi w’umukobga w’i Siyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nk’ukw inyoni ziyerēra icāri gisambutse, ni kw abakobga b’i Mowabu bazomera ku vyambu vya Arunoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tugīre inama, uduhanure, ku murango w’amaminangohe utubere igitūtu kimeze nk’ijoro: uhishe abirukanywe, kandi n’inyererezi ntuz’ uzigonyorere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 22:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abirukanywe banje ubemere babe i wawe: kand’ ab’ i Mowabu ubabere ubuhungiro ku babanyaga. Umunyagahahazo ni yahindurwa ubusa, ukunyaga kugashira, kand’ abasiribanga abantu bagaherengetera mu gihugu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.89.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 89:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
